+          "line_start": 142,
+          "line_end": 145,
+          "text": "**Corollary E1 (the remainders without the logarithm).** As `ℓ ↓ 0`, `∫_{ℓ^{1/5}}^{r_0^*}∫𝐓_r^{eld}(ℓ/r³, u)dσ(u)dr = O(ℓ^{2/3})`,\nand\n\n    ν_eld(ℓ) = cℓ^{−1/3} + c₁ℓ^{1/4} + c₂ℓ^{1/3} + O(ℓ^{2/3}),        ρ_rej(ℓ) = B_{d,L} + (I^{cand} − c₁)ℓ^{1/4} + O(ℓ^{2/3}).   (E1)"
+        },
