+          "line_start": 43,
+          "line_end": 47,
+          "text": "The exact reduction before bounding is\n\n    C_alg = Gamma(7/6)*a*(b^2-a^4)\n            /(8*24^(1/3)*pi^(5/2))\n            * integral_0^(2pi) V(t(theta))^(2/3)/D(t(theta))^(3/2) dtheta."
