+          "text": "**Theorem U⁼ (Lemma U for differences).** For `0 < r ≤ r₄`, `k > 0` and `u`,\n\n    |𝐓_r(k, u) − 𝐓_r(0, u) − r^{−2}𝐀_0(k, u) − [𝐀₂(k, u) − 𝐀₂(0, u)] − 𝓐(k/r, u)| ≤ C (r²min(1, κ) + r min(k, 1/k)).   (U⁼)"
