+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 121,
+          "line_end": 126,
+          "text": "**Corollary LU (with note TS and addendum EM.1).** As `ℓ ↓ 0`,\n\n    ν_eld(ℓ) = c ℓ^{−1/3} + c₁ ℓ^{1/4} + c₂ ℓ^{1/3} + O(ℓ^{2/3}log(1/ℓ)),\n    ρ_rej(ℓ) = B_{d,L} + (I^{cand} − c₁) ℓ^{1/4} + O(ℓ^{2/3}log(1/ℓ)).                                                  (LU)\n\nFor SIDE24 (`d = 3`, `L = 24`, `c = c_{3,24}`): `ν_{3,24}(ℓ) = cℓ^{−1/3}(1 + (c₁/c)ℓ^{7/12} + (c₂/c)ℓ^{2/3} + O(ℓ log(1/ℓ)))`."
