+          "line_start": 44,
+          "line_end": 48,
+          "text": "**Lemma 1.1 (C82's density, localized).** Fix `(λ₂, θ, t)` with `λ₂ > 0` and `γ ≠ 0`. For every `U > 0` and every `x > 0`,\n\n    ∫ 1_T 1{λ̃ ≤ U} 1{|μ| ≤ x} w_λ dλ̃ ≤ 192 x U³,                                                              (1.1)\n\nand the left side without the band indicator is at most `12U³`."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 164,
+          "line_end": 170,
+          "text": "**Theorem BL₃″ (the bounded layer in `d = 3`, at `O(r⁴log(1/r))`).** Uniformly in `b ∈ B₀`, `k ∈ [k₋, k₊]` and the frame, for fixed `Λ ≥ 1` and `0 < r ≤ r_Λ`, A3.6's Theorem BL₃ holds with (b)–(e) replaced by:\n\n    (b″) Q_r^W(D_Λ ∩ (H_r Δ E)) ≤ C_Λr⁴log(1/r);\n    (c″) Q_r^W(D_Λ ∩ H_r) = r³m_E/z₀ + O(r⁴log(1/r)),    Q_r^W(D_Λ ∖ H_r) = r³m_R/z₀ + O(r⁴log(1/r));\n    (d″) Q_r^W(H_r | D_Λ) = m_E/m_Λ + O(r log(1/r));\n    (e″) for every bounded Borel φ on D_Λ × {0, 1},\n         |r^{−3}E_{Q_r^W}[1_{D_Λ}φ(ϑ, 1_{H_r})] − z₀^{−1}∫_{D_Λ}φ(ϑ, 1_E(ϑ))dμ₀| ≤ C_Λ‖φ‖_∞ r log(1/r)."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 190,
+          "line_end": 194,
+          "text": "**Theorem QFE₃′ (every `β < 1`).** Fix `β ∈ (0, 1)`. There are `C_β < ∞` and `r_β > 0`, uniform over `b ∈ B₀`, `k ∈ [k₋, k₊]` and the frame, such that for `0 < r ≤ r_β`\n\n    ‖ν_r^F − ν_0^F‖_var ≤ C_βr^β,      1 − p_r = r³α^{(3)} + O_β(r^{3+β}),                                      (4.3)\n\nand the raw-jet law conditional on failure converges at the same rate."
+        },
+        {
+          "line_start": 213,
+          "line_end": 217,
+          "text": "**Theorem ER₃′ (the endpoint).** There are `C < ∞` and `r_* ∈ (0, e^{−1}]`, uniform over `b ∈ B₀`, `k ∈ [k₋, k₊]` and the frame, such that for `0 < r < r_*`\n\n    ‖ν_r^F − ν_0^F‖_var ≤ Cr log(1/r)⁷,      1 − p_r = r³α^{(3)} + O(r⁴log(1/r)⁷),                                (4.4)\n\nand the raw-jet law conditional on failure converges at the same rate."
