+          "line_end": 71,
+          "text": "**Lemma MB₃ (decision bands without a cut).** For every `δ > 0`, with `C` independent of `δ`,\n\n    μ_r(U ∩ {|μ| ≤ δN}) ≤ C(δ + r),                                                                        (2.3)\n    μ_r(U ∩ {λ₂|μ| ≤ δN²}) ≤ C(δ + r).                                                                     (2.4)"
