+        {
+          "line_start": 134,
+          "line_end": 140,
+          "text": "**Theorem E₃′ (the elder side).** `Good^E` is A3.6's (3.1), and Theorem E₃(a) is unchanged. For `0 < r ≤ r₀` and deterministic `w ≥ 5` with `r^{1/2}w ≤ 1`,\n\n    Q_r^W(E ∖ Good^E) ≤ C r³[w^{−8} + rw^{−4} + e + r√e + r + e⁴ + re² + r²w⁴].                           (5.1)\n\nWith `w = r^{−1/12}`, for `r` small,\n\n    Q_r^W(E ∖ Good^E) ≤ C r^{11/3},    Q_r^W(E ∖ H_r) ≤ C r^{11/3}.                                         (5.2)"
